# Example local dev env. Copy to .env.local ONLY for local development.
#
# WARNING: on the demo/prod box, 127.0.0.1:8000 IS the production backend.
# Do NOT point a dev/build session at it -- that once created stray orgs in the
# prod DB. Prod build config lives outside this repo in
# /home/ubuntu/complivibe-frontend/shared/frontend.env (loaded only by
# scripts/deploy.sh + systemd), never here.
#
# For real local dev, run a local backend and point at it:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8001
